  "id": 203987254823757,
  "uuid": "600c53ec-fa1f-4e1f-b11b-db7eb4c056d9",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "136f9dd0-1863-768f-a6f5-5187a571cf93",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "49077b0a-336a-353d-566e-ef1b71a71212",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"A turning point came during my mother's battle with cancer,\" Salma recalls. \"Witnessing the unwavering support and kindness of her nurse, I realized that nursing was about more than just treatments and medications. It was about human connection.\" ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Salma's aspirations extend beyond becoming a nurse. She envisions herself as a community advocate, educating people about health and combating harmful practices like female genital mutilation (FGM), which is prevalent in her region. Her dream is to conduct research that can bridge healthcare gaps and foster open conversations about well-being. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Choosing AKU was a natural decision for Salma. Renowned for its state-of-the-art facilities and rigorous curriculum, the university provides an ideal environment for aspiring nurses to learn and grow. Salma is particularly excited about the modern library, advanced simulation labs, and the upcoming anatomy lab. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "As she embarks on her nursing journey, Salma is eager to acquire new knowledge and skills. She also looks forward to building lasting friendships with her peers. While she anticipates challenges, such as managing fatigue from the demanding workload, Salma is determined to overcome them. After all, she believes that the greatest rewards often follow the toughest battles.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
