    "show_share": true,
    "description": "From a young age, Salma Abdiaziz Abdikadir was captivated by the nurses who moved through hospital wards with serene confidence and purpose. She marveled at their ability to transform anxiety into a sense of calm, and their knack for making even the most complex medical situations seem manageable. Inspired by their compassionate care, Salma decided to pursue a nursing degree at the Aga Khan University (AKU).",
